msgid "A Facebook group auto poster helps you share a prepared post across the groups you select. Postika combines a post editor, group selection, scheduling, and posting logs in one desktop app."
msgstr "Facebook 群组自动海报可帮助您在您选择的群组中分享准备好的帖子。 Postika 在一个桌面应用程序中结合了帖子编辑器、组选择、日程安排和发布日志。"

msgid "A few things to know"
msgstr "有几件事需要知道"

msgid "A little less busywork. A little more time."
msgstr "忙碌一点。再多一点时间。"

msgid "A supported Windows, macOS, or Linux computer, an installed Chrome or Chromium browser, and your Facebook account. Platform downloads are listed on the downloads page."
msgstr "受支持的 Windows、macOS 或 Linux 计算机、已安装的 Chrome 或 Chromium 浏览器以及您的 Facebook 帐户。下载页面列出了平台下载。"

msgid "Already have a post worth sharing? Import posts from a Facebook page your signed-in account can access. Review the text and images, make your edits, and add the posts you want to your queue."
msgstr "已经有值得分享的帖子了吗？从您登录的帐户可以访问的 Facebook 页面导入帖子。查看文本和图像，进行编辑，然后将所需的帖子添加到队列中。"

msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "开始之前"

msgid "Bring your page posts along."
msgstr "带上您的页面帖子。"

msgid "Browser language"
msgstr "浏览器语言"

msgid "Bulk Poster"
msgstr "散装海报"

msgid "Can multiple Facebook accounts post at the same time?"
msgstr "多个 Facebook 帐户可以同时发帖吗？"

msgid "Check your connection and try again."
msgstr "检查您的连接并重试。"

msgid "Choose a version for your computer. Requires Chrome or Chromium."
msgstr "选择适合您计算机的版本。需要 Chrome 或 Chromium。"

msgid "Choose from 33 interface languages, including right-to-left layouts. Menus, controls, and app-generated log messages follow your choice across windows. And with 189 themes, you can make Postika feel like your own."
msgstr "有 33 种界面语言可供选择，包括从右到左的布局。菜单、控件和应用程序生成的日志消息遵循您在窗口中的选择。凭借 189 个主题，您可以让 Postika 感觉像您自己的一样。"

msgid "Choose your own minimum and maximum interval between posts to avoid posting in rapid succession and help reduce the risk of rate limits or account restrictions. Follow progress as the queue runs, and pause whenever you need to."
msgstr "选择您自己的最小和最大发帖间隔，以避免快速连续发帖，并帮助降低速率限制或帐户限制的风险。跟踪队列运行的进度，并在需要时暂停。"

